  m_text: '<b>Targetting and Attack Tactics</b>


    <color=blue><b>CTRL + Right
    Click</b><color=black> to target an enemy with weapons.

    <b>Snap Rotate</b>
    quickly rotates your ship towards an enemy.

    <color=#00AE6F><b>Cyan Buttons</b><color=black> 
    on the top corner are enemy subsystems.

    <color=red><b>Timeline</b><color=black>
    can be used to plan out weapon attacks. <color=blue><b>Blue weapon buttons</b><color=black>
    allow you to mark when to fire weapons


'
